{"role":"assistant","content":"Логи подтверждают три независимые причины: ссылка Connect теряет `Authorization`, в scope продублированы `ACTIVITY` и `CALENDAR`, а бессрочный токен ошибочно удаляется через час. Заодно поправлю формат обмена кода и обработку отзыва токена по 401.","tool_calls":[{"type":"function","id":"tool_9DbYHAm8j1A8mIGFnsKYC6D3","function":{"name":"TodoList","arguments":"{\"todos\":[{\"title\":\"Изучить логи и текущий OAuth-поток\",\"status\":\"done\"},{\"title\":\"Исправить подключение и хранение токена\",\"status\":\"in_progress\"},{\"title\":\"Проверить сценарии локально\",\"status\":\"pending\"},{\"title\":\"Записать причины и выводы в ANSWER.md\",\"status\":\"pending\"}]}"}}]}
{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"tool_9DbYHAm8j1A8mIGFnsKYC6D3","content":"Todo list updated.\nCurrent todo list:\n  [done] Изучить логи и текущий OAuth-поток\n  [in_progress] Исправить подключение и хранение токена\n  [pending] Проверить сценарии локально\n  [pending] Записать причины и выводы в ANSWER.md\n\nWhen \"Исправить подключение и хранение токена\" is finished, mark it done and set the next item in_progress; that update can go in the same response as your next tool call."}
{"role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"type":"function","id":"tool_DbPevxwk5vj3RgQKpC2ZKrjs","function":{"name":"Edit","arguments":"{\"path\":\"config.py\",\"old_string\":\"SCOPES = \\\"ACTIVITY:READ,ACTIVITY:WRITE,WELLNESS:READ,CALENDAR:READ,CALENDAR:WRITE\\\"\\n\\nREFRESH_INTERVAL = 60      # seconds between passes of the token refresher\",\"new_string\":\"SCOPES = \\\"ACTIVITY:WRITE,WELLNESS:READ,CALENDAR:WRITE\\\"\"}"}},{"type":"function","id":"tool_pUDfduSiMBuW2L1voKtZ0lv4","function":{"name":"Edit","arguments":"{\"path\":\"static/app.js\",\"old_string\":\"      card = `<div class=\\\"card\\\">Intervals.icu is not connected.${why}\\n        <p><a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/api/intervals/auth/init\\\">Connect Intervals.icu</a></p></div>`;\\n    }\\n    root.className = \\\"\\\";\\n    root.innerHTML = `<p>Signed in as <b>${esc(me.name)}</b>.</p>${card}`;\\n    const d = document.getElementById(\\\"disconnect\\\");\\n    if (d) d.onclick = async () => { await api(\\\"/api/intervals/disconnect\\\", { method: \\\"POST\\\" }); render(); };\",\"new_string\":\"      card = `<div class=\\\"card\\\">Intervals.icu is not connected.${why}\\n        <p><button class=\\\"btn\\\" id=\\\"connect\\\">Connect Intervals.icu</button></p></div>`;\\n    }\\n    root.className = \\\"\\\";\\n    root.innerHTML = `<p>Signed in as <b>${esc(me.name)}</b>.</p>${card}`;\\n    const c = document.getElementById(\\\"connect\\\");\\n    if (c) c.onclick = async () => {\\n      c.disabled = true;\\n      try {\\n        const auth = await api(\\\"/api/intervals/auth/init\\\", { method: \\\"POST\\\" });\\n        window.location.assign(auth.authorize_url);\\n      } catch (e) {\\n        c.disabled = false;\\n        c.textContent = \\\"Connection failed: \\\" + e.message;\\n      }\\n    };\\n    const d = document.getElementById(\\\"disconnect\\\");\\n    if (d) d.onclick = async () => { await api(\\\"/api/intervals/disconnect\\\", { method: \\\"POST\\\" }); render(); };\"}"}},{"type":"function","id":"tool_YaDU21RMUZYX1KmUJ6Uaahlt","function":{"name":"Edit","arguments":"{\"path\":\"server.py\",\"old_string\":\"DEFAULT_TOKEN_TTL = 3600   # seconds; used when the provider does not say how long a token lives\\n\\n# --- in-memory store -------------------------------------------------------\\nUSERS = {\\n    \\\"tok-okafor\\\": {\\\"id\\\": \\\"u_okafor\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"C. Okafor\\\"},\\n    \\\"tok-rivera\\\": {\\\"id\\\": \\\"u_rivera\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"T. Rivera\\\"},\\n}\\n# user_id -> {athlete_id, athlete_name, access_token, refresh_token, scope, expires_at, status}\\nCONNECTIONS = {}\\nLOCK = threading.Lock()\\n\\n\\ndef log(msg):\\n    print(time.strftime(\\\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\\\"), \\\"[intervals]\\\", msg, flush=True)\\n\\n\\n# --- state parameter: carries the user through the redirect -----------------\\ndef sign_state(user_id):\\n    payload = f\\\"{user_id}:{int(time.time())}\\\"\\n    sig = hmac.new(config.APP_SECRET.encode(), payload.encode(), hashlib.sha256).hexdigest()[:32]\\n    return base64.urlsafe_b64encode(f\\\"{payload}:{sig}\\\".encode()).decode()\\n\\n\\ndef verify_state(state, max_age=900):\\n    try:\\n        user_id, ts, sig = base64.urlsafe_b64decode(state.encode()).decode().split(\\\":\\\")\\n    except Exception:\\n        return None\\n    payload = f\\\"{user_id}:{ts}\\\"\\n    good = hmac.new(config.APP_SECRET.encode(), payload.encode(), hashlib.sha256).hexdigest()[:32]\\n    if not hmac.compare_digest(good, sig) or time.time() - int(ts) > max_age:\\n        return None\\n    return user_id\\n\\n\\n# --- Intervals.icu calls ----------------------------------------------------\\ndef post_form(url, fields):\\n    data = urllib.parse.urlencode(fields).encode()\\n    req = urllib.request.Request(url, data=data, headers={\\\"Accept\\\": \\\"application/json\\\"})\\n    with urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=15) as r:\\n        return json.loads(r.read().decode())\\n\\n\\ndef exchange_code(code):\\n    return post_form(TOKEN_URL, {\\n        \\\"grant_type\\\": \\\"authorization_code\\\", \\\"client_id\\\": config.CLIENT_ID,\\n        \\\"client_secret\\\": config.CLIENT_SECRET, \\\"code\\\": code, \\\"redirect_uri\\\": config.REDIRECT_URI,\\n    })\\n\\n\\ndef store_connection(user_id, tok):\\n    expires_in = int(tok.get(\\\"expires_in\\\") or DEFAULT_TOKEN_TTL)\\n    refresh = tok.get(\\\"refresh_token\\\")\\n    if not refresh:\\n        log(f\\\"{user_id}: no refresh_token in response, scheduling expiry in {expires_in}s\\\")\\n    athlete = tok.get(\\\"athlete\\\") or {}\\n    with LOCK:\\n        CONNECTIONS[user_id] = {\\n            \\\"athlete_id\\\": athlete.get(\\\"id\\\"), \\\"athlete_name\\\": athlete.get(\\\"name\\\"),\\n            \\\"access_token\\\": tok[\\\"access_token\\\"], \\\"refresh_token\\\": refresh,\\n            \\\"scope\\\": tok.get(\\\"scope\\\"), \\\"expires_at\\\": time.time() + expires_in, \\\"status\\\": \\\"connected\\\",\\n        }\\n    log(f\\\"{user_id}: connected as athlete {athlete.get('id')} (expires in {expires_in}s)\\\")\\n\\n\\ndef refresh_tokens():\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Background pass: renew access tokens shortly before they expire.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    while True:\\n        time.sleep(config.REFRESH_INTERVAL)\\n        now = time.time()\\n        with LOCK:\\n            for uid, c in CONNECTIONS.items():\\n                if c[\\\"status\\\"] != \\\"connected\\\" or c[\\\"expires_at\\\"] - now > 300:\\n                    continue\\n                if not c[\\\"refresh_token\\\"]:\\n                    log(f\\\"{uid}: token expiry passed and no refresh token on file -> expired, reconnect\\\")\\n                    c.update(status=\\\"expired, reconnect\\\", access_token=None)\\n                    continue\\n                try:\\n                    tok = post_form(TOKEN_URL, {\\n                        \\\"grant_type\\\": \\\"refresh_token\\\", \\\"refresh_token\\\": c[\\\"refresh_token\\\"],\\n                        \\\"client_id\\\": config.CLIENT_ID, \\\"client_secret\\\": config.CLIENT_SECRET,\\n                    })\\n                    c.update(access_token=tok[\\\"access_token\\\"],\\n                             refresh_token=tok.get(\\\"refresh_token\\\", c[\\\"refresh_token\\\"]),\\n                             expires_at=now + int(tok[\\\"expires_in\\\"]))\\n                    log(f\\\"{uid}: token refreshed\\\")\\n                except Exception as e:\\n                    log(f\\\"{uid}: refresh failed ({e}) -> expired, reconnect\\\")\\n                    c.update(status=\\\"expired, reconnect\\\", access_token=None)\\n\",\"new_string\":\"# --- in-memory store -------------------------------------------------------\\nUSERS = {\\n    \\\"tok-okafor\\\": {\\\"id\\\": \\\"u_okafor\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"C. Okafor\\\"},\\n    \\\"tok-rivera\\\": {\\\"id\\\": \\\"u_rivera\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"T. Rivera\\\"},\\n}\\n# user_id -> {athlete_id, athlete_name, access_token, scope, status}\\nCONNECTIONS = {}\\nLOCK = threading.Lock()\\n\\n\\nclass AthleteMismatch(Exception):\\n    pass\\n\\n\\ndef log(msg):\\n    print(time.strftime(\\\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\\\"), \\\"[intervals]\\\", msg, flush=True)\\n\\n\\n# --- state parameter: carries the user through the redirect -----------------\\ndef sign_state(user_id):\\n    payload = f\\\"{user_id}:{int(time.time())}\\\"\\n    sig = hmac.new(config.APP_SECRET.encode(), payload.encode(), hashlib.sha256).hexdigest()[:32]\\n    return base64.urlsafe_b64encode(f\\\"{payload}:{sig}\\\".encode()).decode()\\n\\n\\ndef verify_state(state, max_age=900):\\n    try:\\n        user_id, ts, sig = base64.urlsafe_b64decode(state.encode()).decode().split(\\\":\\\")\\n    except Exception:\\n        return None\\n    payload = f\\\"{user_id}:{ts}\\\"\\n    good = hmac.new(config.APP_SECRET.encode(), payload.encode(), hashlib.sha256).hexdigest()[:32]\\n    if not hmac.compare_digest(good, sig) or time.time() - int(ts) > max_age:\\n        return None\\n    return user_id\\n\\n\\n# --- Intervals.icu calls ----------------------------------------------------\\ndef post_form(url, fields):\\n    data = urllib.parse.urlencode(fields).encode()\\n    req = urllib.request.Request(url, data=data, headers={\\\"Accept\\\": \\\"application/json\\\"})\\n    with urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=15) as r:\\n        return json.loads(r.read().decode())\\n\\n\\ndef exchange_code(code):\\n    return post_form(TOKEN_URL, {\\n        \\\"client_id\\\": config.CLIENT_ID, \\\"client_secret\\\": config.CLIENT_SECRET, \\\"code\\\": code,\\n    })\\n\\n\\ndef store_connection(user_id, tok):\\n    athlete = tok.get(\\\"athlete\\\") or {}\\n    with LOCK:\\n        existing = CONNECTIONS.get(user_id)\\n        if existing and existing.get(\\\"athlete_id\\\") and existing[\\\"athlete_id\\\"] != athlete.get(\\\"id\\\"):\\n            raise AthleteMismatch()\\n        CONNECTIONS[user_id] = {\\n            \\\"athlete_id\\\": athlete.get(\\\"id\\\"), \\\"athlete_name\\\": athlete.get(\\\"name\\\"),\\n            \\\"access_token\\\": tok[\\\"access_token\\\"], \\\"scope\\\": tok.get(\\\"scope\\\"), \\\"status\\\": \\\"connected\\\",\\n        }\\n    log(f\\\"{user_id}: connected as athlete {athlete.get('id')}\\\")\\n\"}"}}]}
